{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶり更新ーごめんなさい(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事ではあたたかいコメントありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんなんかねー。みなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬休みに振り返ってみるときにはいい報告がたくさんできるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります(`・ω・')☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の報告＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日夕方はレッスン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん疲れるけれども、歌って踊って疲れるなんて本望ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に今までの楽曲練習したり、名古屋・長崎のリハしたり、えとせとら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそういや明日名古屋じゃん∩^ω^∩！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋行きますよーて方、よろしくお願いしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なイベントにするぞーおーっ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫を撮ってきたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらもよかったらオンエアみてみてーね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらにー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｂ.Ｌ.Ｔ.×乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルＴシャツ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表されましたね(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのデザインしたＴシャツ見たひとー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね、キュートでラブリーな感じに仕上げましたとも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとかぴんくの地になんとかイエローの文字ってゆ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが好きな組み合わせです＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え女の子向きのデザインじゃないかって？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことないからね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんさんならぴんく着てくれると思ってデザインしたからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫。ぴんくはみんな似合う...だろうから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/5998200/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/5998200/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの個別握手で生歌リクエストしたら歌ってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌うたってくれますよ∪・ω・∪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエストしてみるしかー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/5998200/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の子って新幹線で移動するやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そん時にみんな揃ってたら、周りの人に気付かれたりしないんですか！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベント帰りにふぁんの方と同じ新幹線でーてのはよくある話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな私服だしねーにやにや///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/5998200/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとなんでひめたん大分弁しゃべれるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天才やけんっ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーてメンバーさん結構大分弁話しちょんよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ(衛藤美彩chan)せいたん(畠中清羅chan)のおかげやな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/5998200/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって呼んでいいかな？"},{"type":"break"}